// set after the handler leaves by siglongjmp (guarded FFI recovery, an actor failing) and would need
// TLS. sigaltstack(NULL, &ss) is a plain system call. A thread without an alternate stack
// (SS_DISABLE) answers 0; every thread the runtime creates has one. The bounds are strict at both
// ends: an actor's execution stack can be mapped directly below the alternate stack, so its top is
// the alternate stack's base, and the growth fault of the first push of a behavior interrupts code
